<!--
     Shop-floor execution (garment_production) — the suite's flagship module.

     Masters: 2 sewing lines (line_sewing_1 / line_sewing_2) with their
     machines (single-needle/overlock/flatlock), 2 work centers (cutting,
     sewing), and 1 operation routing for style_tee (10-operation sewing
     bulletin with SMV).

     order_tee is the deep example: prod_order_tee is 'running' on
     line_sewing_1, with 4 work orders (cutting/sewing/finishing/packing), a
     cutting order + marker + 4 bundles, 6 daily production entries
     (2026-04-20 to 2026-04-25) showing a first-week efficiency ramp-up as
     the line balances onto the new style, 1 OEE snapshot, 1 resolved machine
     breakdown, and 1 fabric material issue from wh_main.

     order_polo / order_hoodie stay light: prod_order_polo is 'planned'
     (queued behind the tee run on line_sewing_1), prod_order_hoodie is
     'released' and queued onto line_sewing_2 (BalticHaus AW26 style,
     production starting after the tee run completes, per DEMO_STORY.md's
     Apr-May 2026 production window).
-->
